# TPOWER Brand Logo & Brand Safe Area

## Brand Safe Area (global)

Reserve approximately **5% of image width and 5% of image height** on **every edge** as protected padding.

- Source of truth: `src/config/brand-safe-area.ts` (`BRAND_SAFE_RATIO = 0.05`)
- Stamp pipeline: `scripts/lib/brand-logo.mjs`
- CSS frames: `.brand-safe-media`, `.brand-safe-overlay`, `.brand-safe-chips`

**Nothing may enter the protected edge zone:**

- Official logo
- Text / headlines baked into art
- Badges, chips, stickers
- Critical product UI or focal subjects

This prevents clipping from responsive layouts, `overflow:hidden`, and rounded corners.

## Official logo

- Use **only** `public/logo/tpower-logo.png` (or `tpower-mark.png` when mark-only is required).
- Never create, redraw, redesign, or approximate the logo.
- Never replace it with AI-generated text or fake branding.
- Do not stretch, crop, rotate, distort, or recolor the logo.

## Logo placement

- Default: top-left of the **content box** (just inside the 5% safe padding).
- Never place the logo flush to the canvas edge or inside the protected 5% zone.
- Keep proportions; logo should not dominate (~6% of content width; clamp ~40–96px).

## Container / CSS rules

- Wrap marketing images with `brand-safe-media`.
- Place UI chips with `brand-safe-chips` (inside safe area, below the logo).
- **Do not** use `group-hover:scale-*` on branded media.
- If overflow/radius would clip branding, fix inset or layout — never ship clipped logos.

## Generating artwork

1. Compose art with a mental 5% margin on all sides — keep important elements inside.
2. Do not invent a logo in AI prompts as readable brand text.
3. Stamp with `npm run brand:stamp` or `npm run brand:restamp`.
4. Do not ship marketing visuals without the official logo inside the safe area.

## Exclusions

- Third-party provider logos (`public/providers/**`, `public/images/providers/**`)
- Payment marks (`public/images/payments/**`)
- Favicons (`public/icons/**`)
- Logo files themselves (`public/logo/**`)
- **Game thumbnails** (`public/images/games/**`, `public/games/**`) — never stamp or overlay the TPOWER logo on game artwork. Identify providers in card metadata below the image only.
